<h3><u>Karbala da kafan gareeb jeddah</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>karbala da kafan ghareeb jadha&#39;n koi paway hussain(a.s.) yaad aandaeysar khulay weer day janazay tay bhe&#39;nrh aaway hussain(a.s.) yaad aandaey</p>

<p>&nbsp;(dohrha)bekafan day shehar da kafan jada&#39;n (x2)<br />
wich jag tay koi pendaey<br />
kar yaad ghareebi bekas di<br />
har munsif neer waheendaeye wain lagdae<br />
yoo ewain lagdaey bekafani dipiya hasrat syed(a.s.) mitendaeyjada&#39;n aap rehya hai baajh kafanpiya aj taie&#39;n kafan wadendaey</p>

<p>kejhi aa shaan hin shareefa&#39;n tay dhee(s.a.) to&#39;n nikhrhay huway musafir day<br />
chaar(4) saalaa&#39;n di dhee(s.a.) koo&#39;n seenay tay (x2)<br />
koi samaway hussain(a.s.) yaad aandaey</p>

<p>zuljanah di shabeeh to&#39;n puchday hain lahwa&#39;nrha&#39;n zeen to&#39;n musafir dazuljanah momina&#39;n day haalay wich (x2)paasa laway hussain(a.s.) yaad aandaey</p>

<p>kendi taskoo&#39;n khiraj dendi aey ronday ronday sabeel hanjwaa&#39;n dinaam nehr-e-furat da koi (x2)bhul kay chaway hussain(a.s.) yaad aandaey</p>

<p>bahween(22) saalaa&#39;n day putr wich dhhal gaey kon turda rehiya bazara&#39;n wichkoi sajjad(s.a.) di za&#39;eefi da (x2)wai&#39;nrh paaway hussain(a.s.) yaad aandaey</p>

<p>surkh parcham eendi mazar utay ahdaey koi nai&#39;n oo&#39;nda rehiya &quot;gohar&quot;naam mehdi(a.s.) da adl day keetay (x2)lab tay aaway hussain(a.s.) yaad aandaey</p>
